{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Gym Bro 是一款健身記錄應用，適合初學者與有經驗的訓練者建立自訂課表、記錄組數次數、追蹤身體數據與飲食熱量，並可完全離線使用。此版本原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，方便使用者整理訓練進度與保持規律。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-139.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自訂訓練與進度追蹤</h2>\n<p>Gym Bro 提供自訂訓練計劃、動作資料庫與圖表化進度追蹤，亦可記錄飲食與每日熱量，並透過 OpenFoodFacts 自動匯入食物資料。程式支援獎盃挑戰、離線使用、自訂主題，以及從其他健身追蹤應用匯入資料，讓使用者集中管理訓練與身體數據。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-162-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-163-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-164-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-165-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-166-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-167-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Gym Bro – Your Workout Buddy</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/gym-bro-your-workout-buddy/id6745848077?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.362413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":311,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T17:34:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:55:18.046211+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:05.952852+00:00","content_hash":"c7b5f4afc13ca2282329d2c48fd9a161ab1c58b6e3d97be4cb7e4141ffafe9bb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}